  "content": "<h1>PixelBlades PRB 附加包</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5d5fb202b8ad727811d60d4825d0a357f1f0c97c_0.webp\" alt=\"应用了 PBR 的钻石斧\"></p>\n<p>一个添加了微妙 PBR（物理渲染）效果的附加资源包，专为与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fuBtkjTQc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pixelblades</a> 配合使用而创建。</p>\n<p>它应该适用于 PixelBlades 的两个变体：普通版和 2D 版。</p>\n<h3>注意事项：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><p>本附加包在 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a></strong> 的<em>高预设</em>下效果最佳；因为我的所有测试都是基于此进行的。</p></li>\n<li><p>要使用它，你需要在着色器设置中启用 labPBR。</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bb5403a1c8b7ff486607582295ec5f19088f3ca0_0.webp\" alt=\"PBR 开关对比\"></p>\n<h3><strong>查看我的其他资源包</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pixelblades\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/203dacdeff3225b7fe133c21ef85201bb0879eb0_0.webp\" alt=\"PixelBlades\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pixelblades2d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/13b973dbee0739aa12b14bbccea286938b899105.png\" alt=\"PixelBlades 2D\"></a></p>\n<p>如果你有任何想法想分享，或者遇到问题想要报告，请通过 Instagram 私信我：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fmr.payy%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@mr.payy</a></strong></p>",
